! For acetaldehyde mechanism, please cite: Caravaca-Vilchez, J., Döntgen, M. & Heufer, K. A. (2025). Acetaldehyde reactivity at engine-relevant conditions: An experimental and kinetic modeling study. PROCI.


! The original GalwayMech1.0 is developed based on NUIGMech1.3 with further refining C0-C7 reactions. Please cite all papers below
! when referencing it.   For MTBE mechanism, please cite reference #1  For the first stage igntiion of n-pentane, please
! cite reference #2  For n-decane and its blends, please cite reference #3#4   Paper to be cited 1. J. Chen, A. A.
! El-Sabor. Mohamed, P. Wang, Y. Zhai, S.S. Nagaraja, C. Zhou, H. Curran, A Comprehensive Experimental and Kinetic
! Modeling Study of Methyl Tert-Butyl Ether Combustion, Proc. Combust. Inst. 2. P. Wang, J. Caravaca-Vilchez, T. Nagy,
! S. Dong, X. Cheng, K. A. Heufer, H. J. Curran, A focus on the first-stage ignition of n-pentane, Combust. Flame 3. S.
! Zhou, A. A. E. Mohamed, S. S. Nagarajab, P. Wang, Y. Murakami, P. K. Senecal, H. J. Curran, An experimental and
! modeling study of hydrogen/n-decane blends, Combust. Flame 4. J. Liu, S. Zhou, P. Wang, Y. Murakami, A. A. E. Mohamed,
! M. Raza, A. Nolte, K.A. Heufer, P. K. Senecal, H. J. Curran, An experimental and kinetic modeling study of the
! ignition of methane/n-decane blends, Combust. Flame

